{
  "id": "JOB.12",
  "number": "12",
  "bookId": "JOB",
  "reference": "Job 12",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "12",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOB 12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "12",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Job answered and said,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No doubt but ye",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.12.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.12.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the people, and wisdom shall die with you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But I have understanding as well as you; I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.12.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.12.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not inferior to you: yea, who knoweth not such things as these?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I am",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "as",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.12.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.12.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "one mocked of his neighbour, who calleth upon God, and he answereth him: the just upright",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "man is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.12.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.12.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "laughed to scorn.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He that is ready to slip with",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "his",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.12.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.12.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "feet",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is as",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.12.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.12.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a lamp despised in the thought of him that is at ease.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The tabernacles of robbers prosper, and they that provoke God are secure; into whose hand God bringeth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "abundantly",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.12.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.12.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But ask now the beasts, and they shall teach thee; and the fowls of the air, and they shall tell thee:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Or speak to the earth, and it shall teach thee: and the fishes of the sea shall declare unto thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Who knoweth not in all these that the hand of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.12.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.12.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hath wrought this?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In whose hand",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.12.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.12.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the soul of every living thing, and the breath of all mankind.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Doth not the ear try words? and the mouth taste his meat?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "With the ancient",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.12.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.12.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wisdom; and in length of days understanding.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "With him",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.12.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.12.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wisdom and strength, he hath counsel and understanding.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, he breaketh down, and it cannot be built again: he shutteth up a man, and there can be no opening.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, he withholdeth the waters, and they dry up: also he sendeth them out, and they overturn the earth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "With him",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.12.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.12.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "strength and wisdom: the deceived and the deceiver",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.12.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.12.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "his.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He leadeth counsellors away spoiled, and maketh the judges fools.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He looseth the bond of kings, and girdeth their loins with a girdle.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He leadeth princes away spoiled, and overthroweth the mighty.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He removeth away the speech of the trusty, and taketh away the understanding of the aged.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He poureth contempt upon princes, and weakeneth the strength of the mighty.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He discovereth deep things out of darkness, and bringeth out to light the shadow of death.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He increaseth the nations, and destroyeth them: he enlargeth the nations, and straiteneth them",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "again",
              "type": "text",
